+                        +" same_type_and_tag_strategy="+(strategy!=null && strategy==referenceStrategy));
+            }
+            tabIndex++;
+        }
+        System.out.println("MF_NATIVE kind=tab_census_complete non_search_tabs="+tabIndex);
